 "text": [
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 56,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "A/B test report · online medical consultation · 18 Nov – 29 Dec 2024"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h1",
   "y": 83,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The new flow gets patients a doctor faster everywhere, but drives dermatology patients away"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 237,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "18,000 users of an online consultation service were split into a control group and a treatment group. In the treatment group, doctors answered 22 seconds sooner at the median (88 vs 110), but the overall completion rate did not move. The reason is a single department: in dermatology, the share of treatment users who left before seeing a doctor went from 7.7% to 12.7%, which cancelled out small gains everywhere else."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 438,
   "x": 297,
   "w": 48,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "88s"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 438,
   "x": 521,
   "w": 80,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "87.9%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 438,
   "x": 744,
   "w": 77,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "12.7%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 438,
   "x": 968,
   "w": 67,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "9.8%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "small",
   "y": 448,
   "x": 352,
   "w": 51,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "vs 110s"
  },
  {
   "tag": "small",
   "y": 448,
   "x": 607,
   "w": 68,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "vs 88.0%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "small",
   "y": 448,
   "x": 827,
   "w": 55,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "vs 7.7%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "small",
   "y": 448,
   "x": 1041,
   "w": 58,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "vs 6.8%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 475,
   "x": 297,
   "w": 176,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "median time to first doctor response, treatment vs control"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 475,
   "x": 521,
   "w": 176,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "consultations completed: no overall change"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 475,
   "x": 744,
   "w": 176,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "dermatology users who left before reaching a doctor"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 475,
   "x": 968,
   "w": 176,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "new users who came back within 7 days"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 598,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The setup: a clean split across five departments"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 636,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The groups are well balanced: 9,013 users in control and 8,987 in treatment, entering over the same 42 days. Pediatrics (5,246 users) and internal medicine (5,083) are the busiest departments, followed by dermatology (3,121), gynecology (2,490) and ENT & eye (2,060). Each user's journey can end in one of three ways:"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 768,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 200,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Completed: (88.0%)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 768,
   "x": 502,
   "w": 324,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Reached a doctor, not completed: (7.0%)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 768,
   "x": 848,
   "w": 231,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Left before a doctor: (5.0%)"
  },
  {
   "tag": "b",
   "y": 770,
   "x": 376,
   "w": 46,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "15,836"
  },
  {
   "tag": "b",
   "y": 770,
   "x": 745,
   "w": 35,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "1,261"
  },
  {
   "tag": "b",
   "y": 770,
   "x": 1003,
   "w": 28,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "903"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 800,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Every user who left before a doctor has no response time recorded, and every user who did not complete has no consultation length, so the three outcomes don't overlap."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 901,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Doctors answered faster in the treatment group almost every day"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 939,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The median wait for a first doctor response was 88 seconds in treatment against 110 seconds in control. Treatment had the lower daily median on 39 of the 42 days. The advantage grew under load: from 9 December traffic rose (9,909 users in the last 21 days against 8,091 in the first 21) and the control median jumped from 86 to 132 seconds, while treatment rose only from 77 to 96. The gap widened from 9 to 36 seconds."
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1126,
   "x": 316,
   "w": 25,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "160s"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1136,
   "x": 706,
   "w": 209,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "from 9 Dec: higher traffic, longer waits"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1166,
   "x": 1043,
   "w": 68,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
