  },
  {
   "tag": "figcaption",
   "y": 1428,
   "x": 299,
   "w": 842,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Daily median seconds until a doctor first responds, by group. Users who left before a doctor have no response time and are not included."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1468,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Completed consultations were also a little shorter in treatment, with a median of 10.4 minutes against 11.2."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 1551,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Yet completion did not move, because dermatology went the other way"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1589,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Overall, 5.3% of treatment users left before a doctor against 4.7% of control, and completion was flat at 87.9% versus 88.0%. Splitting by department shows why the faster responses did not pay off. In four departments the groups are within one point of each other, and treatment is slightly better in most of them. Dermatology stands apart."
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1738,
   "x": 471,
   "w": 41,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "control"
