  {
   "tag": "figcaption",
   "y": 2667,
   "x": 299,
   "w": 842,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Share leaving before a doctor, by dermatology chief complaint (original complaint text in grey)."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2707,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Outside dermatology the treatment was mildly positive: 3.8% of users left before a doctor against 4.1% in control, and 89.4% completed against 88.7%. The data does not say what the treatment changed in the flow. Because the loss happens before a doctor responds, though, the likely suspect is a pre-consultation step, such as an intake form or a photo upload, that dermatology patients find harder to finish."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 2872,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "New users came back more; returning users less"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2910,
   "x": 728,
   "w": 432,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Across all users, the 7-day follow-up rate was unchanged: 12.1% in treatment against 12.3% in control. Underneath, it moved in opposite directions. Among new users it rose from 6.8% to 9.8% , and among returning users it fell from 14.9% to 13.2% ."
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 2949,
   "x": 308,
   "w": 22,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "18%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 2970,
   "x": 534,
   "w": 33,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "14.9%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 2987,
   "x": 590,
   "w": 33,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "13.2%"
  },
  {
