   "x": 372,
   "w": 28,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "6.8%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 3060,
   "x": 728,
   "w": 432,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Returning users make up about two-thirds of each group, so the two shifts almost cancel. Whether more follow-ups is good depends on what a follow-up means here. It could be repeat engagement, or it could mean the first consultation did not resolve the problem."
  },
  {
