   "text": "Share who had a follow-up within 7 days, control (grey) vs treatment (orange)."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 3293,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "What to do with this"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 3331,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Before rolling out, find the step in the treatment flow that dermatology patients abandon, and fix or exempt it. If dermatology performed as well under treatment as it does under control, the faster responses and slightly better completion seen elsewhere would be a clear win."
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 3448,
   "x": 280,
   "w": 880,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The file has one row per user (18,000 rows, no duplicate IDs). Some cleaning was needed:"
  },
  {
   "tag": "b",
   "y": 3464,
   "x": 301,
   "w": 84,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Data notes."
