   "x": 319,
   "w": 823,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "3 rows wrote the entry date with slashes (2024/12/02, 2024/12/19, 2024/12/27). These were normalised."
  },
  {
   "tag": "li",
   "y": 3540,
   "x": 319,
   "w": 823,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "7 users have a first-response time over an hour, from 15,543 to 71,396 seconds, while the next-largest value is 922 seconds. 7 consultations last exactly 640 minutes, while the next-longest is 76.7. These look like logging errors. Medians are used throughout, so they don't affect the results."
